00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.500
Six?!

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:12.250
That’s fine...that’s totally fine

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:15.125
Is, uh, now a good time? Ser Kristaps is here to see—

00:01:15.125 --> 00:01:16.166
Oh yes, yes!

00:01:16.166 --> 00:01:19.083
