-It is not him

00:01:26.083 --> 00:01:28.750
Oh! Kristaps?

00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:30.541
You’re...you’re on House Mavericks?

00:01:30.541 --> 00:01:31.541
I am, yeah

00:01:31.541 --> 00:01:35.458
Lord Mark, this is...truly a wonderful gift

00:01:35.458 --> 00:01:36.500
Oh, it’s nothing

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:38.125
Almost makes up for...

00:01:38.125 --> 00:01:40.250
