00:01:45.375 --> 00:01:46.458
Chandler Parsons.

00:01:46.458 --> 00:01:47.333
Alright, OK

00:01:47.333 --> 00:01:48.791
Not good

00:01:48.791 --> 00:01:51.500
OK, well, I will let you boys alone to talk about

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:53.291
whatever European things you guys wanna talk about

00:01:53.291 --> 00:01:55.916
like wine and bread and cheese.  

00:01:55.916 --> 00:01:58.625
I get it. All right. Later, dudes!

00:01:58.625 --> 00:02:00.791
Mark is actually... 

00:02:00.791 --> 00:02:02.291
He’s a very cool guy

00:02:02.291 --> 00:02:05.250
Your grace, I want to learn everything you have to teach me

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:07.583
