00:02:11.458 --> 00:02:12.625
Yes. Please.

00:02:12.625 --> 00:02:14.291
Loyalty

00:02:14.291 --> 00:02:14.333
Loyalty

00:02:14.333 --> 00:02:19.333
For 56 years, I have worn only House Mavericks colors,

00:02:19.333 --> 00:02:22.000
even as those colors went through

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:23.791
