00:02:23.791 --> 00:02:26.875
And though I showed my opponents no mercy,

00:02:26.875 --> 00:02:31.125
I made no enemies because I betrayed no house

00:02:31.125 --> 00:02:32.125
Tell me, 

00:02:32.125 --> 00:02:36.583
why did you abandon your house? Your fanlings?

00:02:36.583 --> 00:02:39.583
Well...I was on House Knicks, and—

00:02:39.583 --> 00:02:40.416
Oh, oh—say no more

00:02:40.416 --> 00:02:42.958
OK, yikes, yikes. Never mind.

00:02:42.958 --> 00:02:43.000
OK, yikes, yikes. Never mind.

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:45.416
Kristaps, do you then swear 

00:02:45.416 --> 00:02:49.375
your loyalty to House Mavericks?

00:02:49.375 --> 00:02:50.625
Yes, I do

00:02:50.625 --> 00:02:51.625
Well then,

00:02:51.625 --> 00:02:55.416
