00:04:55.916 --> 00:04:56.958
Yes, anything.

00:04:56.958 --> 00:04:58.583
Even though I’m clearly a center?

00:04:58.583 --> 00:05:01.250
Oh, whatever you want. Because together, 

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:02.875
